{"id":"967fd715c999aad8","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-lem-gg.md","title":"Gödel's Diagonal Lemma","display":"lem-gg — Gödel's Diagonal Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-gg","aliases":["58-lem-gg"],"display":"lem-gg — Gödel's Diagonal Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-provable.md]]","[[58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-comp-primitive-recursive-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-gg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-gg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gg — Gödel's Diagonal Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"582b96e73e5d1c6e\" href=\"?note=582b96e73e5d1c6e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-provable.md\">../batch08/58-df-provable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable.md\">58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60d957ce43061cb6\" href=\"?note=60d957ce43061cb6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md\">../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" href=\"?note=a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md\">../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" href=\"?note=7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0461bada1f5a4e50\" href=\"?note=0461bada1f5a4e50\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-comp-primitive-recursive-function.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-comp-primitive-recursive-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\Sigma,Q_\\Sigma,\\varphi,v,\\psi,g,d,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,0_\\Sigma,S_\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(T,\\Sigma,Q_\\Sigma,\\varphi,v,\\psi,g,d,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,0_\\Sigma,S_\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(Q_\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> is the fixed Robinson-arithmetic axiom set</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma\\)</span> (capture-avoiding formula-substitution operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (term set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagonalizableCoding}_S(d,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma,v)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagonalizableCoding}_S(d,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma,v)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\\)</span> (computably-enumerable-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompPrimitiveRecursiveFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompPrimitiveRecursiveFunction}_S\\)</span> (primitive-recursive-function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)\\)</span> (effective-theory predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\omega,\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma))\\land\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(0)=0_\\Sigma\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(n+1)=S_\\Sigma(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(n)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\omega,\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma))\\land\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(0)=0_\\Sigma\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(n+1)=S_\\Sigma(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(n)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonalizable\\text{-}coding}\\vdash\\mathrm{DiagonalizableCoding}_S(d,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma,v)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCompPrimitiveRecursiveFunction}_S(d)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v\\}\\to d(g(\\theta))=g(\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\theta,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(g(\\theta)),v))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonalizable\\text{-}coding}\\vdash\\mathrm{DiagonalizableCoding}_S(d,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma,v)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCompPrimitiveRecursiveFunction}_S(d)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v\\}\\to d(g(\\theta))=g(\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\theta,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(g(\\theta)),v))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(\\{g(\\theta)\\mid\\theta\\in T\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(\\{g(\\theta)\\mid\\theta\\in T\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gg}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(Q_\\Sigma\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)\\land\n\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists d\\;\\mathrm{DiagonalizableCoding}_S(d,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma,v)\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v\\}\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi)=\\varnothing\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\varphi,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(g(\\psi)),v)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gg}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(Q_\\Sigma\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)\\land\n\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists d\\;\\mathrm{DiagonalizableCoding}_S(d,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma,v)\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v\\}\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi)=\\varnothing\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\varphi,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(g(\\psi)),v)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Gödel codes and numerals are explicit functions: the c.e. axiom-code set is a bounded image under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>, and self-substitution uses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(g(\\psi))\">\\(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(g(\\psi))\\)</span> rather than informal corner-quote notation.</li>\n<li>Used in proofs of incompleteness and Tarski's theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"l